{
  "_comment": "Copy to tauri.dev-local.json (gitignored) and set your LAN IP, then: npx vite dev --host 0.0.0.0 and npx tauri android build --debug --apk --config ./src-tauri/tauri.dev-local.json. Overrides the url ONLY — never the identifier (Tauri binds gen/android to one identifier).",
